within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.R_RespiratorySystem.R06A_AntihistaminesForSystemicUse.R06AX25_Mizolastine;
model Mizolastine_Deschamps2000_PD_wheal
  "indirect_response_i exposure-response sweep — Deschamps_2000 :: wheal (wheal)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Interfaces.PartialExposureResponseSweep(
    E0 = 3.01587301587,      // [cm2]
    Emax = 0.87,  // type I effect term
    EC50 = 4.39e-05,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
equation
  response = E0*(1 - Emax*frac);   // steady state, indirect response type I
  // e0_from_kin_kout: no baseline row; E0 = kin/kout (1.9/0.63 = 3.016) — the paper's stated baseline may differ
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 440, Interval = 0.88),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Mizolastine_Deschamps2000_PD_wheal</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Deschamps C et al., <i>Clinical pharmacology and therapeutics 68(6):647–657</i> 2000 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1067/mcp.2000.112341\">doi:10.1067/mcp.2000.112341</a>) — wheal [cm2] against mizolastine ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: indirect_response_i.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    = 3.01587301587 cm2      drug-free response (baseline) (kin/kout, Q327/Q328)
  Emax  =       0.87          maximal effect term (maximum attainable inhibition of the effect production, Q323)
  EC50  =       43.9 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (mizolastine concentration that produced 50% suppression of the maximum attainable inhibition of k(in), Q322)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <code>response = E0*(1 - Emax*frac)</code>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of mizolastine per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 3.016   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (43.9 ng/mL)  response 1.704
  exposure -> infinity  response 0.3921</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Deschamps_2000: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Mizolastine_Deschamps2000_PD_wheal;
